{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChM9GJ4AnAbMUHBokDUfF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LT6SDZ1dapYbDdGXyveV3L","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled; grep -n \"^ *step_\\|^ *phase_\\|fanout_lineage\\|append-mode-event\\|convergence.cjs\\|reduce-state\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -150","description":"List YAML steps"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16798,"cache_read_input_tokens":62467,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16798},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:44:39.489Z","request_id":"<redacted>","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LT6SDZ1dapYbDdGXyveV3L":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled; grep -n \"^ *step_\\|^ *phase_\\|fanout_lineage\\|append-mode-event\\|convergence.cjs\\|reduce-state\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -150","description":"List YAML steps"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LT6SDZ1dapYbDdGXyveV3L","type":"tool_result","content":"41:    phase_loop_purpose: \"Dispatch review agent iterations with approval at each step\"\n71:  config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir: \"[optional internal path] - Fan-out lineage artifact override for command-owned single-lineage execution.\"\n163:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n227:  step_resolve_artifact_root:\n230:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n233:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n234:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n236:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n245:  step_bind_reducer_artifact_arg:\n247:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n255:  step_bind_convergence_write_arg:\n257:    note: \"step_graph_convergence runs on a dry run as a preview. A live run passes --record-blocked-stop, which makes convergence.cjs append a real row on a BLOCKED decision. A dry run writes nothing, so it passes --read-only instead, which also keeps the script from persisting the graph snapshot or appending its observability event.\"\n266:  step_fanout_dry_run_preview:\n313:  step_apply_lifecycle_request:\n347:  step_reject_extend_with_fanout:\n359:  step_reject_frontier_caps_with_fanout:\n370:  step_frontier_seed:\n377:      phase_init, so the seed runs here or not at all. fanout-run.cjs then splits\n400:  step_fanout_spawn:\n425:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n426:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n428:      step_fanout_scope_discovery:\n441:      step_fanout_root_config:\n446:          step_update_config_status and a later --restart both read the root config. Write\n469:      step_fanout_spawn_cli:\n494:  phase_init:\n498:      step_preflight_contract:\n510:      step_create_directories:\n515:      step_detect_resource_map:\n526:      step_migrate_legacy_review_state:\n576:      step_acquire_lock:\n595:      step_extend_completed_run:\n606:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n607:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n622:      step_snapshot_extended_review_report:\n639:      step_classify_session:\n730:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n731:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n745:      step_scope_discovery:\n779:      step_order_dimensions:\n795:      step_normalize_review_dimensions:\n810:      step_normalize_review_focus:\n818:      step_resolve_session_id:\n828:      step_create_config:\n881:      step_frontier_scope:\n899:      step_frontier_seed:\n902:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n917:      step_frontier_budget:\n920:        skip_when: \"extension_pending == true or config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n939:      step_create_state_log:\n950:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n951:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n960:      step_record_restarted_run:\n966:      step_create_findings_registry:\n972:      step_create_strategy:\n987:      step_seed_coverage_graph:\n989:        fanout_graph_store: 'When config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID is set, this run is a fan-out lineage and its coverage graph store is {artifact_dir}/graph-db, inside the lineage write surface. The fan-out runner exports DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR to that directory. Run this step against it and never skip it as a write outside the lineage; when DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR is absent from the environment, prefix the command with DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR=\"{artifact_dir}/graph-db\".'\n1008:      step_enrich_strategy_context:\n1015:      step_enrich_strategy_resource_map:\n1021:      step_frontier_reduce_seed:\n1027:          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\n1031:      step_init_complete:\n1069:  phase_loop:\n1075:      step_refresh_lock:\n1080:      step_record_artifact_migration:\n1087:      step_read_state:\n1133:      step_check_max_duration:\n1152:      step_check_pause_sentinel:\n1164:      step_validate_convergence_config:\n1171:      step_graph_convergence:\n1172:        action: \"Run convergence.cjs once: it evaluates the coverage graph and computes the whole review stop decision\"\n1173:        fanout_graph_store: 'When config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID is set, this run is a fan-out lineage and its coverage graph store is {artifact_dir}/graph-db, inside the lineage write surface. The fan-out runner exports DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR to that directory. Run this step against it and never skip it as a write outside the lineage; when DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR is absent from the environment, prefix the command with DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR=\"{artifact_dir}/graph-db\".'\n1178:          1. Call convergence.cjs once on the current review lineage. It returns the graph decision and the stop_decision object.\n1183:        bash: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs --spec-folder \"{spec_folder}\" --loop-type \"review\" --session-id \"{session_id}\" --convergence-mode \"{convergence_mode}\" --depth-mode \"{depth_mode}\" --stop-decision --config-path \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" --iteration-count \"{iteration_count}\" --security-sensitive-fix-scope \"{security_sensitive_fix_scope}\" --fix-replay-required-rows 