{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JPUueGt6yohk8rcF2n22B6","type":"tool_result","content":"67:$ git grep -n \"mcp-chrome-devtools\\|mcp-aside-devtools\" HEAD -- .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling ':!*/changelog/*' ':!*/benchmark/*' ':!*.json' | grep -v \"mcp-browser-use/mcp-\" | wc -l\n69:$ git grep -c \"mcp-browser-use\" HEAD -- .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-click-up | wc -l\n120:| REQ-003 | ClickUp names the hub where it chooses a browser | `rg -c 'mcp-browser-use' .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-click-up/references/mcp-tools.md` prints 3 |\n59:The browser hub's docs and scripts describe a bdg and a Code Mode that no longer behave that way. Readers copy `bdg cdp` calls with positional JSON, which bdg 0.6.10 rejects. They also copy Code Mode blocks with top-level `await`, which the wrapper refuses, and run `install.sh`, which finds no Chrome on macOS. A request to attach to the operator's own Chrome also routed nowhere.\n120:| REQ-001 | No doc in scope passes JSON to `bdg cdp` as a positional argument | `rg \"bdg cdp [A-Za-z]+\\.[A-Za-z]+ ['\\\"{]\"` over the topic scope and hub root prints nothing |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:52:01.158Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"67:$ git grep -n \"mcp-chrome-devtools\\|mcp-aside-devtools\" HEAD -- .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling ':!*/changelog/*' ':!*/benchmark/*' ':!*.json' | grep -v \"mcp-browser-use/mcp-\" | wc -l\n69:$ git grep -c \"mcp-browser-use\" HEAD -- .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-click-up | wc -l\n120:| REQ-003 | ClickUp names the hub where it chooses a browser | `rg -c 'mcp-browser-use' .skilled/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-click-up/references/mcp-tools.md` prints 3 |\n59:The browser hub's docs and scripts describe a bdg and a Code Mode that no longer behave that way. Readers copy `bdg cdp` calls with positional JSON, which bdg 0.6.10 rejects. They also copy Code Mode blocks with top-level `await`, which the wrapper refuses, and run `install.sh`, which finds no Chrome on macOS. A request to attach to the operator's own Chrome also routed nowhere.\n120:| REQ-001 | No doc in scope passes JSON to `bdg cdp` as a positional argument | `rg \"bdg cdp [A-Za-z]+\\.[A-Za-z]+ ['\\\"{]\"` over the topic scope and hub root prints nothing |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/observability-events.jsonl","hunks":[{"oldStart":34,"oldLines":3,"newStart":34,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"event_id\":\"eeb01a06-dda8-489f-8fd7-ec27179cb69c\",\"producer\":\"fanout-run\",\"stream\":\"orchestration-status\",\"subject\":{\"run_id\":null,\"label\":\"opus-2\",\"loop_type\":null,\"spec_folder\":null},\"event\":\"progress\",\"status\":\"running\",\"observed_at_iso\":\"2026-11-24T04:51:08.389Z\",\"payload\":{\"event\":\"progress\",\"label\":\"opus-2\",\"at\":\"2026-11-24T04:51:08.389Z\",\"duration_ms\":424621,\"gauges\":{\"lag\":4,\"pending\":0,\"failed\":0}}}"," {\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"event_id\":\"5d7b9e60-82f6-4d0c-acf8-cf234974a429\",\"producer\":\"fanout-run\",\"stream\":\"orchestration-status\",\"subject\":{\"run_id\":null,\"label\":\"opus-3\",\"loop_type\":null,\"spec_folder\":null},\"event\":\"progress\",\"status\":\"running\",\"observed_at_iso\":\"2026-11-24T04:51:15.980Z\",\"payload\":{\"event\":\"progress\",\"label\":\"opus-3\",\"at\":\"2026-11-24T04:51:15.980Z\",\"duration_ms\":428815,\"gauges\":{\"lag\":4,\"pending\":0,\"failed\":0}}}"," {\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"event_id\":\"fec4159a-7c51-4926-ae80-77f59506d3a8\",\"producer\":\"fanout-run\",\"stream\":\"orchestration-status\",\"subject\":{\"run_id\":null,\"label\":\"opus-4\",\"loop_type\":null,\"spec_folder\":null},\"event\":\"progress\",\"status\":\"running\",\"observed_at_iso\":\"2026-11-24T04:51:22.276Z\",\"