ecision-capture/5c421355472b/35383765623564642d623532322d343839382d396565322d613033613035363365336164.nudge\n./specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/observability-events.jsonl\n./specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/orchestration-status.log","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/lineages/opus-1/prompts/closeout/synthesis_complete.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":1,"lines":["+{\"stem\":\"deep_review.synthesis_complete\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"fanout-opus-1-1795495435655-lf6jf3\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opus-1-1795495435655-lf6jf3\"},\"data\":{\"mode\":\"review\",\"totalIterations\":7,\"activeP0\":0,\"activeP1\":1,\"activeP2\":8,\"dimensionCoverage\":1,\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"releaseReadinessState\":\"in-progress\",\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\"}}"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled/specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/review/lineages/opus-1/review-report.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":130,"lines":["+# Deep Review Report - mcp-browser-use hub epic (fan-out lineage opus-1)","+","+## 1. Executive Summary","+","+- **Overall verdict: FAIL.** `review-verdict.cjs` over the lineage registry and state log returned `verdict FAIL, active_p0 0, active_p1 1, active_p2 8, search_debt 0, failed_required_gate_ids [\"coverage\"]`. No P0 exists. The FAIL comes from the coverage gate (`traceability-incomplete`): the hard core protocols `spec_code` and `checklist_evidence` ended `partial`, because a real spec mismatch (O1-I1-P1-001) and checklist drift are still active. Without the gate failure the findings alone would map to CONDITIONAL.","+- hasAdvisories: false (only set on PASS).","+- Counts the verdict used: P0 = 0, P1 = 1, P2 = 8.","+- Stop reason: `maxIterationsReached` (7 of 7). Release readiness: `in-progress`.","+- Adversarial self-check: one active P1. The iteration-7 re-read confirmed O1-I1-P1-001 at P1 (the two `_utils.sh` copies still differ at line 160). No downgrade and no false positive, so no claim-adjudication rows were appended.","+- Review scope: 470 pre-bound files (review-scope-files.txt): the 13 phase packets, the `mcp-browser-use` hub (277 files), the compiled routing lib, the advisor scorer, doctor scripts and related docs.","+- Operator review focus: every phase's shipped work against its goal criteria","+","+## 2. Planning Trigger","+","+`/speckit:plan` is required: one active P1 and a failed coverage gate.","+","+```json","+{","+  \"Planning Packet\": true,","+  \"triggered\": true,","+  \"verdict\": \"FAIL\",","+  \"hasAdvisories\": false,","+  \"activeFindings\": [","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I1-P1-001\", \"severity\": \"P1\", \"dimension\": \"correctness\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/_utils.sh:160\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I1-P2-001\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"correctness\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/references/troubleshooting.md:327\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I1-P2-002\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"traceability\", \"file\": \"specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/003-mode-relocation/goal.md:1\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I2-P2-001\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"security\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-bladebro/scripts/install.sh:111\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I2-P2-002\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"security\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/install.sh:28\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I3-P2-001\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"traceability\", \"file\": \"specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/spec.md:146\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I3-P2-002\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"traceability\", \"file\": \"specs/mcp/mcp-browser-use/001-mcp-browser-use-hub/graph-metadata.json:53\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I4-P2-001\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"maintainability\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/changelog/v1.0.27.0.md:15\"},","+    {\"id\": \"O1-I6-P2-001\", \"severity\": \"P2\", \"dimension\": \"maintainability\", \"file\": \".skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:35\"}","+  ],","+  \"remediationWorkstreams\": [\"WS1 installer helper parity (O1-I1-P1-001)\", \"WS2 phase goal and parent metadata hygiene (O1-I1-P2-001, O1-I1-P2-002, O1-I3-P2-001, O1-I3-P2-002)\", \"WS3 install supply chain (O1-I2-P2-001, O1-I2-P2-002)\", \"WS4 release history and counts (O1-I4-P2-001, O1-I6-P2-001)\"],","+  \"specSeed\": [\"Restore byte parity of the two _utils.sh copies and add the mcp-installers test to the hub's gate list\"],","+  \"planSeed\": [\"Sync or revert check_node default in one _utils.sh copy; rerun node --test .skilled/bin/tests/mcp-installers.test.cjs\"],","+  \"findingClasses\": \"UNKNOWN\",","+  \"affectedSurfacesSeed\": \"UNKNOWN\",","+  \"fixCompletenessRequired\": true","+}","+```","+","+`findingClasses` and `affectedSurfacesSeed` are UNKNOWN because the iteration state records' `findingDetails` carry only id, severity, title, file and dimension; the class and surface lines live in the iteration narratives only, and the step forbids inferring them from prose.","+","+## 3. Active Finding Registry","+","+| ID | Sev | Dimension | File:line | Issue | Fix |","+|----|-----|-----------|-----------|-------|-----|","+| O1-I1-P1-001 | P1 | correctness | `mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/_utils.sh:160` | Phase 013 (commit 1a350b1512b) raised `check_node_version`'s default from 18 to 20 and changed the install hint in the Chrome DevTools copy only; `mcp-code-mode/scripts/_utils.sh:160` still says 18. `.skilled/bin/tests/mcp-installers.test.cjs:49` asserts byte parity, so `node --test` exits 1 (5 tests, 1 fail). This breaks 003's goal criterion 4 and 013's own REQ-006 \"No hub gate regresses\" (013 spec.md:130); 013's verification table never ran the test. The change bought no behavior: install.sh passes `MIN_NODE_VERSION=\"20\"` explicitly (install.sh:30). | Change both copies together (or revert the default), then rerun the test. |","+| O1-I1-P2-001 | P2 | correctness | `mcp-chrome-devtools/references/troubleshooting.md:327` | 011's criterion `rg -c 'Session target not found\\|returnByValue'` expects 3; it prints 5 since 013 added lines 327 and 826. | Update 011's recorded evidence or note the later change. |","+| O1-I1-P2-002 | P2 | traceability | `003-mode-relocation/goal.md`, `004-bladebro-mode/goal.md` | Both phases say Complete while every goal criterion is `[ ]`. 004's hold; four of 003's five hold, the fifth fails per O1-I1-P1-001. | Tick the boxes that hold after WS1 lands. |","+| O1-I2-P2-001 | P2 | security | `mcp-bladebro/scripts/install.sh:111` | `npm install -g` runs lifecycle scripts before the SHA-256 check at :130; R-SEC-3 says verify before use. | Install with `--ignore-scripts`, verify, then run any needed scripts, or document why scripts are safe. |","+| O1-I2-P2-002 | P2 | security | `mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/install.sh:28` | Installs `browser-debugger-cli@alpha` (floating) while 013 D1 pins every documented behavior to bdg 0.6.10. | Pin `browser-debugger-cli@0.6.10` or gate on the version. |","+| O1-I3-P2-001 | P2 | traceability | `spec.md:146` | Handoff row 006 -> 007 is `[Criteria TBD] \\| [Verification TBD]` in a Complete parent. | Fill from 007's goal criteria. |","+| O1-I3-P2-002 | P2 | traceability | `graph-metadata.json:53` | Parent says `in_progress`, last active child 012; spec.md:17,24 say next action \"Start 002-hub-scaffold\" and completion 0; goal.md:24 completion 0. | Refresh parent continuity and graph metadata. |","+| O1-I4-P2-001 | P2 | maintainability | `mcp-chrome-devtools/changelog/v1.0.27.0.md:15` | 013 changed 36 chrome-devtools and 21 aside-devtools files (install.sh behavior included) without new versions; it rewrote the released v1.0.27.0 entry, and Aside got no entry. | Add chrome-devtools 1.0.28.0 and an Aside entry; keep released entries frozen. |","+| O1-I6-P2-001 | P2 | maintainability | `mcp-aside-devtools/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:35` | Validator warns `HAND_TYPED_CENSUS (29 scenarios, 8 categories)`; correct today, drift-prone. | Derive the census or drop the number. |","+","+Disposition of every row: active. Count note: iteration 7's narrative says \"seven P2 advisories\"; the registry holds 8 P2. The iteration file is write-once and is left as written; this report uses 8.","+","+## 4. Remediation Workstreams","+","+1. WS1 (P1): O1-I1-P1-001. Make the two `_utils.sh` copies identical; rerun `node --test .skilled/bin/tests/mcp-installers.test.cjs`.","+2. P2 advisories: WS2 metadata hygiene (O1-I1-P2-001, O1-I1-P2-002, O1-I3-P2-001, O1-I3-P2-002); WS3 install supply chain (O1-I2-P2-001, O1-I2-P2-002); WS4 release history and counts (O1-I4-P2-001, O1-I6-P2-001).","+","+## 5. Spec Seed","+","+- A remediation child under the hub packet: restore installer helper parity and list `mcp-installers.test.cjs` among the hub gates a phase must rerun.","+- Fill the parent's 006 -> 007 handoff row and refresh parent continuity.","+","+## 6. Plan Seed","+","+- T1: Sync `check_node_version` in both `_utils.sh` copies; run the parity test (expect 5/5).","+- T2: Tick 003/004 goal boxes that hold; update 011 evidence count.","+- T3: Pin bdg in install.sh; add `--ignore-scripts` ordering to the Bladebro installer.","+- T4: Add chrome-devtools 1.0.28.0 and an Aside changelog entry for 013's changes.","+","+## 7. Traceability Status","+","+### Core Protocols","+","+| Protocol | Status | Evidence | Unresolved drift |","+|----------|--------|----------|------------------|","+| `spec_code` (hard) | partial | Parent criteria 1-4 re-verified; stage-two routing replays route each mode; 003 criterion 4 and 013 REQ-006 broken | O1-I1-P1-001 |","+| `checklist_evidence` (hard) | partial | 009/010/013 criteria confirmed | O1-I1-P2-001, O1-I1-P2-002, O1-I3-P2-001, O1-I3-P2-002 |","+","+### Overlay Protocols","+","+| Protocol | Status | Evidence |","+|----------|--------|----------|","+| `skill_agent` | pass | Own-Chrome lift needs an attach verb (fusion.ts:623); no `--account`; live manual consent (chrome-devtools SKILL.md:86) |","+| `agent_cross_runtime` | pass | Runtime skill dirs symlink to `.skilled/skills`; no stale packet paths in agents or root docs |","+| `feature_catalog_code` | pass | 31 leaves, TOTAL 31 (feature-catalog.md:243) |","+| `playbook_capability` | pass | Validators violations=0 for all three packages; run tallies match READMEs |","+","+AC_COVERAGE: not computed (validate.sh is barred inside this lineage).","+","+## 8. Deferred Items","+","+- Parent criterion 5 stage one (advisor replay) and criterion 7 (`validate.sh --strict --recursive`) were not re-run: the advisor may start a daemon that writes outside the lineage, and validate.sh is barred by the dispatch.","+- 012 criterion 1 (`doc-alignment.cjs scope`) not re-run.","+- Four Aside playbook scenarios were edited by 013 after the 2026-11-22 recorded runs; no rerun records the new wording.","+- No frontier (default depth mode).","+","+## Dimension Expansion Map","+","+- Saturated directions: none recorded. Completed pivots 0, failed pivots 0, audited overrides 0. No Council artifacts. Remaining frontier: none.","+- Passes: correctness (1, 5), security (2, 7), traceability (3, 6), maintainability (4, 7).","+","+## 9. Search Ledger","+","+- searchCoverage (latest reducer state): required `secret_exposure`, `consent_bypass`; both ruled out; graphCoverageMode `graph`.","+- Across iterations, ledger rows covered: criterion_regression, cross_copy_drift (findings), supply_chain (2 findings), destructive_command and consent_bypass (ruled out), status_drift (2 findings), scope_creep (ruled out), release_drift (finding), version_mismatch (ruled out), routing_regression and evidence_tally_drift (ruled out), count_drift (finding), stale_mirror_path (ruled out), secret_exposure (ruled out).","+- searchDebt: [] (hasSearchDebt: false).","+","+## 10. Audit Appendix","+","+- Convergence: ratios 1.0, 0.25, 0.17, 0.07, 0.0, 0.06, 0.0. Convergence check after iteration 4 (read-only) returned CONTINUE (evidenceDensity, unfinished core protocols). Stop at the iteration cap. Terminal gates: evidence pass, scope pass, coverage fail (`traceability-incomplete`).","+- Dimension coverage: 4 of 4.","+- Ruled out: stale mcp-tooling browser paths; Aside curl installer (operator-invoked); teardown rm -rf regression (prior R2-P1-001 fix holds); 013 scope creep (Devin, freshness declared in 013 spec.md:91); 403 Forbidden reject regression (prior C2-I1-P1-001 fix holds, canary present); results.csv tally drift; JSON routing version mismatch; stale mirror paths; credential leakage in browser manuals.","+- Sources: see each iteration's Files Reviewed.","+","+### Workflow deviations (provenance)","+","+- `step_acquire_lock` was not run in this lineage, so there is no lock to release.","+- The lineage config was first written with the root's `fanout` key copied in; it was removed before synthesis so the lineage takes the single-executor branches. The run-open row's contentDigest reflects the earlier bytes.","+- Convergence was first evaluated after iteration 4 and only with `--read-only`; no blocked-stop rows were written.","+- Per-iteration graph upserts for iterations 1-4 were backfilled after iteration 4; 5-7 ran per iteration.","+- `step_generate_context` skipped: the dispatch bans `generate-context.js`; the dispatch's write limits override the YAML here.","+- A scratch file `/tmp/opus1-inst.txt` was written outside the lineage during iteration 1 and has been deleted."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0